looooo/SMESH patch/netgen_occt781.patch, the netgen part: include
TopTools_MapOfOrientedShape.hxx only (netgen 6.2.2101).

Source: looooo/SMESH, `patch/netgen_occt781.patch`, commit 479b7ad70 ("add patch for
netgen", 2024-07-14). The looooo patch has two sections; this is its
`libsrc/occ/Partition_Loop3d.hxx` section, verbatim. The other section changes the toolkit
list of looooo's own CMake file for netgen, which pySMESH does not use (pySMESH builds netgen
with cmake/Netgen/CMakeLists.txt). OCCT 7.8 removed TopTools_OrientedShapeMapHasher.hxx,
and TopTools_ShapeMapHasher.hxx is no longer needed by this header.

diff --git a/libsrc/occ/Partition_Loop3d.hxx b/libsrc/occ/Partition_Loop3d.hxx
index e171669..aea8734 100644
--- a/libsrc/occ/Partition_Loop3d.hxx
+++ b/libsrc/occ/Partition_Loop3d.hxx
@@ -26,12 +26,9 @@
 #include <Standard_Version.hxx>
 #endif
 
-#if OCC_VERSION_HEX < 0x070000
-#else
-   #include <TopTools_ShapeMapHasher.hxx>
-   #include <TopTools_OrientedShapeMapHasher.hxx>
-   #include <TopTools_MapOfOrientedShape.hxx>
-#endif
+
+#include <TopTools_MapOfOrientedShape.hxx>
+
 
 class TopoDS_Shape;
 
